# "# [NNNN] title" keep NeverSink's numbering (emitters select by them).

# [2901] Exceptions #1

Show # uniques.sekhemaring
	Sockets > 0
	Rarity Unique
	BaseType == "Ring"
	SetFontSize 45
	PlayAlertSound 1 300
	PlayEffect Red
	MinimapIcon 0 Yellow Star

